MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B01_m01_003: Hoy, House Lamine!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B01_m01_001: Your ship is being readied but is not yet seaworthy.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B01_m01_002: It will be ready on the {SetColor=Gold}twenty-first of Jula{SetColor=Default}. Come\nback later!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B01_m01_004: I hope I'm not speaking out of turn here, but Cetus is\nnot like other creatures. It might be unstoppable.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B01_m01_005: Please make careful preparations before heading to\nthe harbor.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B01_m01_006: Once you set sail, you won't be able to return to\nDagsion, so double-check your preparations.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c08_B01_m01: <BLN>The {SetColor=Gold}twenty-first of Jula{SetColor=Default} is the day!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01_001: It seems it is time to make preparations for\nour journey.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01_002: We will be far from Dagsion, and we may not return\nfor some time.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01_003: As we will be traveling the seas, do you have a desire\nto return to Fódlan after Cetus is slain?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01_004: <NCA>Admit to fleeting thoughts of it.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01_005: <NCB>Deny the impulse.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01_006: <ACA>Oh, indeed? That is something of a surprise to me.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01_007: <ACB>I should hope not. I too would remain in this land.\nThere is much to be done.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01_008: I suppose that, as compared to this land, you find the\nmores of Fódlan quite restrictive.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c08_Fab_m01: <BLN>We must prepare.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Esm_m01_001: I overheard you and Orchel talking about your sister.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Esm_m01_002: I'd like to know more about her. I'm an only child,\nso I always wonder what it's like to have a sister.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Esm_m01_003: You seem to care about her a lot. But you left her all\nalone in Fódlan!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Esm_m01_004: Oh, she's strong enough to take care of herself?\nWell, OK!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Esm_m01_005: If you trust her, she must be special.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c08_Esm_m01: <BLN>Will your sister be OK by herself?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Mic_m01_001: Ships aren't my favorite, but I'm not going\nto complain.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Mic_m01_002: After all, since I first met you, I've been in your debt.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Mic_m01_003: Giant monster? Bring it on! It'll be a nice way to\ntest myself.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Mic_m01_004: Be it land or sea, you can rely on Mikaela Redblade!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c08_Mic_m01: <BLN>I owe you a debt.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Set_m01_001: I've heard the rumors. They say that you seek a\nreturn to the sea—to slay a monster.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Set_m01_002: But let me take this opportunity to say that you\nwill not escape my attention.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_Set_m01_003: Though, frankly, I too wonder about this "Cetus,\nthe Sea Tyrant," and its true nature.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c08_Set_m01: <BLN>I am dwelling on it too...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B02_m01_001: Tell me—it is not true, is it? You mean to challenge\nCetus, the Sea Tyrant?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B02_m01_002: If it is...I will make my way to the temple of Aurora\nimmediately and offer a prayer for your safety.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B02_m01_003: Take this token. May it bring you back unharmed.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c08_B02_m01: <BLN>It can't be true!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B03_m01_001: Have you been down to the port? One of Dagda the\nGreat's warships is moored there!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B03_m01_002: I'm dumbfounded that they would leave a such a\nhistoric ship just...just sitting there!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c08_B03_m01: <BLN>Seen it yet?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c08_B04_m01_001: I heard you're gonna fight Cetus! Is it true? Is it?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c08_B04_m01: <BLN>Is it true?